<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 12.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 12.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	13.30    1.88</p>
<p> 2   Cudgen R.Z.	     9.43    2.65</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 9.40    1.04</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.38    0.80</p>
<p> 5   Natl Consol	     9.00    1.00</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 8.70    1.16</p>
<p> 7   Centro Prop	     8.63    2.23</p>
